    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Glimvale! \u2665</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/5244bd8c0f396f2680207532adcde10f.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=168 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, decorate, and grow your village in this cozy city-builder. A relaxing game where your world keeps evolving, even when you're away !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a600da81c7e6b30b578a2f3b451ebb49.avif?t=1754646151\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Note:</strong> All screenshots show a WIP version, still in development. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a1a0332c963711e00eb93321a4fdf1a5.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Glimvale, you create your own village and ensure adventurers feel happy and relaxed as they craft items, cook delicious meals, collect mascots, and explore small dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your world as welcoming as possible by decorating the environment and shaping it to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a9dcffde6f0ac3575f749f2281f20dd1.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glimvale is a peaceful and relaxing management game where you watch your village flourish and fill with adventurers as you improve it. Witness <strong>Bookmark Paladins, Plaid Mages, and Knitting Thieves</strong> joyfully roam your town. \u2665 Build dungeons for them to gain experience and gold, then customize and upgrade them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 A Latte Caf\u00e9 Tavern ? You got it !   <br>\ud83e\udd58 Customization for every building ? Yes !   <br>\ud83d\udcda Book staircases ? Absolutely !   <br>\ud83d\udc34 A collection of fantastic mounts ? You bet !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/c1b6fc417564df5dd06427db88975761.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=171 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 High replay value, idle game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Create and customize your own adorable town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Place small decorations to beautify your village and delight adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Manage buildings by customizing their functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Provide for your adventurers' needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Sandbox mode, have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Idle game without being frustrating. See your little village come to life, and even other adventurer villages to go further !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milkshake Games is a small team working on heartfelt indie games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four of us collaborated on Glimvale:  <br><strong>Alexandre</strong> (Game Developer)  <br><strong>Ilona</strong> (2D Artist)  <br><strong>Elodie</strong> (Sound Design, Music)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you !\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Glimvale! \u2665</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/5244bd8c0f396f2680207532adcde10f.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=168 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, decorate, and grow your village in this cozy city-builder. A relaxing game where your world keeps evolving, even when you're away !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a600da81c7e6b30b578a2f3b451ebb49.avif?t=1754646151\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Note:</strong> All screenshots show a WIP version, still in development. \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a1a0332c963711e00eb93321a4fdf1a5.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Glimvale, you create your own village and ensure adventurers feel happy and relaxed as they craft items, cook delicious meals, collect mascots, and explore small dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your world as welcoming as possible by decorating the environment and shaping it to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/a9dcffde6f0ac3575f749f2281f20dd1.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glimvale is a peaceful and relaxing management game where you watch your village flourish and fill with adventurers as you improve it. Witness <strong>Bookmark Paladins, Plaid Mages, and Knitting Thieves</strong> joyfully roam your town. \u2665 Build dungeons for them to gain experience and gold, then customize and upgrade them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 A Latte Caf\u00e9 Tavern ? You got it !   <br>\ud83e\udd58 Customization for every building ? Yes !   <br>\ud83d\udcda Book staircases ? Absolutely !   <br>\ud83d\udc34 A collection of fantastic mounts ? You bet !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403590/extras/c1b6fc417564df5dd06427db88975761.avif?t=1754646151\" width=600 height=171 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 High replay value, idle game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Create and customize your own adorable town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Place small decorations to beautify your village and delight adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Manage buildings by customizing their functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Provide for your adventurers' needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Sandbox mode, have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 Idle game without being frustrating. See your little village come to life, and even other adventurer villages to go further !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milkshake Games is a small team working on heartfelt indie games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four of us collaborated on Glimvale:  <br><strong>Alexandre</strong> (Game Developer)  <br><strong>Ilona</strong> (2D Artist)  <br><strong>Elodie</strong> (Sound Design, Music)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you !\u00a0</p>",
